attr[seg_0000:3a84]: type = code; name = vm_op_draw_menu; comment = [[[
    Opcode 0x4b of vm_statement_table. Arity 1, writes ss:[0c0e] as a byte, and calls
    menu_draw_item. Attributed by measurement (T29c): it runs 30-46 times whenever the
    character ACTION menu is drawn and never in the idle baseline, confirmed across five
    different triggers. The first VM primitive tied to a visible game behaviour.
]]]
